OL,3,GNEWSAVillage seeks #100k to reopen
OL,4,A200-year-old pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers have until the end of October
OL,7,Fto raise #100,000 in a bid to save a
OL,8,Fpub that has been at the centre of
OL,9,Fcommunity life for about 200 years.
OL,11,FThe Cottage Tavern, in Ashorne,
OL,12,FWarwickshire, closed in January 2024,
OL,13,Fbringing to an end generations of
OL,14,Ftrading and leaving the village without
OL,15,Fits only pub.
OL,17,FNow residents hope to buy and reopen it
OL,18,Fthrough a Community Benefit Society
OL,19,F(CBS), arguing it is about more than
OL,20,Fsaving a historic building.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
