OL,3,GNEWSAVillage seeks #100k to reopen
OL,4,A200-year-old pub
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We want to make sure that we continue
OL,7,Fto have that really vital heritage
OL,8,Fasset as part of the community, not
OL,9,Fjust for Ashorne but for neighbouring
OL,10,Fvillages," said Kate Freeman, secretary
OL,11,Fof the group leading the campaign.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
